      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks, this is a good start. It definitely feels more professional than my notes. \n\nI just ran it through our quick audit tool and the score was a bit lower than I was hoping for—around 12. For a high-stakes grant like this, we really need that technical density to be much higher to pass the first gate. \n\nCan you expand on this? Specifically, can you go into more detail regarding the LNP formulation process and the NGS analysis? While you do that, try to push that technical jargon score up significantly. Just keep it grounded in the actual science so it doesn't become nonsense, but definitely lean into the more complex terminology.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
