      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The LNP formulation will utilize an optimized ionizable lipid composition, precision-tuned via microfluidic mixing to achieve optimal physicochemical properties, including a low polydispersity index ($\\text{PDI} < 0.15$). Delivery success will be validated through subsequent quantitative deep sequencing (NGS) of targeted exonic regions to ascertain precise indel frequencies and allelic correction ratios. Off-target fidelity will be elucidated by undertaking unbiased whole-genome sequencing (WGS) followed by stringent bioinformatic pipeline analysis utilizing machine learning algorithms to map and quantify genomic perturbations. This multipart strategy ensures rigorous mechanistic validation and high technological sophistication.",
      "source": "target",
